```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "mint a fresh canonical bag, keeping the old one as an underlay"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///engine.recipe.rotates", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/engine.recipe.rotates"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/engine.recipe.rotates"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.recipe.rotates ~ nix-style generations for a wiki's canon

`lares wiki rotate-recipe <slug>` asks the daemon to mint a fresh canonical bag for the wiki and retain the old one as a previous-canon underlay, naming the stack after.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ rotate

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`rotate` params=`slug/works ~ rotate the wiki's canon`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ slug

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`slug` params=`takes/slug needs/required seat/1 as/<slug> ~ the wiki slug`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ vessel

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`vessel` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the daemon verb runs under the vessel's own did; this handler checks no ocap of its own`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · daemon-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[engine.recipe.rotates slug/works]] ~ name the slug`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`daemon-refused` params=`~ the daemon's rotate-recipe verb refused; its message rides the line, exit 4`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ rotated

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`rotated` params=`exit/0 fields/[[stack]] ~ the stack after the rotation`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares wiki rotate-recipe

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares wiki rotate-recipe]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/edges`>>

!! edges ~ affordance · cabal-realm

<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance`>>
<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/cabal-realm`>>

